# The PyrixOS test image: the default system of pkgs/95-systems.pyb with
# root logged in on the serial console. Build its disk image with
#
#     lattice build --package-set pkgs pkgs/systems/default.pyb image
#
# and boot it in QEMU with scripts/boot-test.sh. A machine of your own
# is installed from the installer image of installer.pyb, which writes
# `default_system` with a root password instead.

system = pyrixos_system("default", default_file_systems(), services=[serial_autologin])

image = disk_image(system)
